## ☁️ Configuration & Deployment

**Environment Parity & Config Caching** — Verifies `config()` and `env()` usage boundaries. Ensures production builds use `php artisan config:cache` and environment-specific overrides are isolated.
- **Use when:** Reviewing deployment scripts, staging-to-prod promotions, or multi-environment setups.
- **Source:** https://laravel.com/docs/13.x/configuration#configuration-caching

**Automated Quality Gates** — Configures CI to run `php artisan test` and Laravel Pint before human review. PHPStan/Larastan are not installed and must not be treated as required unless explicitly added. Security, architecture, and business logic must always undergo mandatory human review.
- **Use when:** Setting up CI/CD workflows, scaling review throughput, or enforcing baseline standards.
- **Source:** https://laravel.com/docs/13.x/pint